            "review_title": "Review at Jungle Box",
            "review_text": "Oliver M\n1 contribution\n0\nJungle box an undiscovered treasure, waiting for you to find!\nAug 2025 • Family\nGreat place, unknown by most! Definitely go In and check this place out. Great place for starting your night, finishing off or just going to chill. \n\nThe staff are very helpful and accommodating. We have our 8 year old son and the guys where great with him. \n\nJust a lovely place to chill and unwind.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nStaff love to chat and practise there English, very polite and well mannered. Great guys! Great place! Oh and the food is very tasty...\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 16, 2025",
